Sval: record performance profiles to a file from about:support and about:processes

Firefox's profiler opens its results on profiler.firefox.com, which Sval
never contacts. SvalProfiler records with the same profiler and saves the
result in the download folder, so about:support gets a button that starts
and saves a recording, and about:processes' per-process button saves
through it instead of opening the profiler's site. Both are disabled while
a private window is open, since a profile would hold its pages.

